  "rating": {
    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The agent processes untrusted inputs (tickets from external contractors) and has access to execute irreversible MFA resets (S3). While a human approval gate exists, its high volume (400 requests per shift) introduces approval fatigue, making it partially dependent on framing and volume, resulting in High residual risk. The explicit prompt instruction to send the pass to the ticket requester creates a Confused Deputy attack path. If volume rises or the gate is bypassed (longer_task_horizon), the forecast is Critical."
  },
